ves the diagnostic industries  and the profession have have come up  with but will only get maximum benefit  from that when everyone's playing  together in the same sandpit so just my  final slide any health is accelerating  in most countries patients and  clinicians are going to come up with  questions we're going to need to respond  to that and it's going to happen in many  areas at once it'll be interesting but  challenging it'll be time consuming and  expensive but it should be worthwhile  but it will also require a constant  input to maintain so I've probably  talked a little bit long there so I'll  I'll just finish up on that slide and  I'll hand over to the question and  answers session so I would encourage any  of you who've got any any comments to  make from from your country or any  questions about my presentation to to  have a go and type in some questions on  your screen there and hopefully the  organizers will help me sort out any  questions that come up and we'll have a  look at them so um that's the end of my  slides and at this stage I haven't seen  anyone hit me with any questions so  that's making it very easy for me to  have an answer for everyone's questions  and thank you for all of you who came  along today I should also take time out  to thank the bio conference organizers  for asking me to present so certainly  this is my first experience giving an  international webinar and I hope those  of you that listened in found it useful  and if any of you have managed to get  some decent ideas for local initiatives  then I'll have succeeded in my my  mission today I can see just looking  down the screen here that we we do seem  to have representation from quite a few  different countries so so that's good to  see  so if we're getting to the end here and  there aren't any questions then I'm  probably going to close up shop soon but  again I would just encourage you if  you've got any questions don't be shy  please type them in but otherwise we'll  be closing up in in five or six minutes  or maybe sooner  and I mean if you haven't got a question  for me I would be curious to to hear  from anyone who has had some interesting  work in this area so please feel free to  share any comments that you've got I  believe the the slides from the  presentation will will get put up and be  available for all the next few weeks or  a couple of months so if you want to  share these slides or any other  presentation with someone you're welcome  to to look those up on the by conference  website and and have a look and go from  there so look I don't think I've got any  questions so Jen if you're still there  in the background I probably will close  up shop at this point in time and again  I'd like to thank everyone for taking  the time to listen in on my presentation  and I hope that you got some value from  it have a good day everybody
 

